{"id":"6330178076c4520f","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set.md","title":"Shoenfield Δ₂ 跳跃反演的集合构造","display":"lem-shoenfield-inversion-set — Shoenfield Δ₂ 跳跃反演的集合构造","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set","aliases":["20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set"],"display":"lem-shoenfield-inversion-set — Shoenfield Δ₂ 跳跃反演的集合构造","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.5.15；Remark 6.5.14","source_printed_pages":[145,146],"source_pdf_pages":[179,180],"depends_on":["[[20-df-partial-compatibility]]","[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-relative-ce]]","[[20-df-jump]]","[[20-thm-relative-limit]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-thm-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-shoenfield-inversion-set — Shoenfield Δ₂ 跳跃反演的集合构造"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.5.15；Remark 6.5.14"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span><span>146</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>179</span><span>180</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cea21e174a04417\" href=\"?note=8cea21e174a04417\" title=\"20-df-partial-compatibility\">20-df-partial-compatibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d984717bb6601580\" href=\"?note=d984717bb6601580\" title=\"20-thm-relative-limit\">20-thm-relative-limit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(S\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TS\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TS\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing&#39;}\">\\(S\\in\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing&#39;}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8cea21e174a04417\" href=\"?note=8cea21e174a04417\" title=\"20-df-partial-compatibility\">20-df-partial-compatibility</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2c15e9656c322806\" href=\"?note=2c15e9656c322806\" title=\"20-df-relative-ce\">20-df-relative-ce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e890b3c29e4a70a3\" href=\"?note=e890b3c29e4a70a3\" title=\"20-df-jump\">20-df-jump</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d984717bb6601580\" href=\"?note=d984717bb6601580\" title=\"20-thm-relative-limit\">20-thm-relative-limit</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2ea8548c98f572c3\" href=\"?note=2ea8548c98f572c3\" title=\"20-thm-jump\">20-thm-jump</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shoenfield\\text{-}inversion\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land A&#39;\\equiv_TS].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shoenfield\\text{-}inversion\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\land A&#39;\\equiv_TS].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>-可计算有限递增枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\">\\(S_s\\)</span>，允许空步骤。按原书此证明的方向，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 的第二坐标作列。构造增长的偏函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_s\">\\(\\sigma_s\\)</span> 及有限已强迫指标集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_s\">\\(F_s\\)</span>。阶段状态以有限数据表示：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in S_s\">\\(y\\in S_s\\)</span> 的整列除有限例外已写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin S_s\">\\(y\\notin S_s\\)</span> 的列仅有有限多个已定义位；故每个固定状态的定义域及已定义值是普通可计算的。</p>\n<p>阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le s\">\\(e\\le s\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\notin F_s\">\\(e\\notin F_s\\)</span>，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 判定是否存在有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_s\">\\(\\sigma_s\\)</span> 相容，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^\\pi(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^\\pi(e)\\)</span> 停止，且凡 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 新规定的位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y&lt;e\">\\(y&lt;e\\)</span>，均规定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。这是以当前有限状态为参数的普通 c.e. 存在性问题。若有，选择最小这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 及固定搜索顺序中的第一个见证，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 并入偏函数并把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_s\">\\(F_s\\)</span>。每个指标至多成功一次。然后对新进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的列把全部尚未定义位写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；对其他尚未定义且编码位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le s\">\\(\\le s\\)</span> 的位写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。从不修改已定义值。</p>\n<p>每个位置在有限阶段都已定义，且阶段状态可由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 统一计算，故得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。被强迫的停止见证永久保留，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_sF_s\\subseteq A&#39;\">\\(\\bigcup_sF_s\\subseteq A&#39;\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in S\">\\(y\\in S\\)</span>，进入阶段前该列只定义有限信息，其后剩余位全为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin S\">\\(y\\notin S\\)</span>，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le y\">\\(e\\le y\\)</span> 的至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y+1\">\\(y+1\\)</span> 次强迫能在该列新写入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，其他强迫和阶段填位都写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。因此对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lim_x\\chi_A(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\chi_S(y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lim_x\\chi_A(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\chi_S(y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>右侧是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算近似的逐点极限，相对极限引理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\le_TA&#39;\">\\(S\\le_TA&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>下面以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 决定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in A&#39;\">\\(e\\in A&#39;\\)</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 归纳。已知所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;e\">\\(i&lt;e\\)</span> 的真实跳跃答案，模拟构造，等到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\\upharpoonright e=S\\upharpoonright e\">\\(S_s\\upharpoonright e=S\\upharpoonright e\\)</span>，并等到所有答案为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;e\">\\(i&lt;e\\)</span> 已被强迫；归纳保证此等待停止。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 已被强迫，回答是。否则在这个阶段用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TS\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\le_TS\\)</span> 问 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 有无上述容许停止见证。</p>\n<p>此后没有更低列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y&lt;e\">\\(y&lt;e\\)</span> 进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，也没有较小指标再强迫；所以当前未定义的这些低列位在最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中全是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。若存在容许见证，所有较小而未强迫指标均不可能有容许见证（否则最小者的行动会使归纳中答案为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的指标真实停止），故下一次强迫步骤选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，回答是。若不存在，而最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A(e)\">\\(\\Phi_e^A(e)\\)</span> 却停止，取其覆盖全部查询的有限前缀：它与当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_s\">\\(\\sigma_s\\)</span> 相容，且新低列位均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，正是一个容许见证，矛盾。回答否。这样既证明每个真实停止指标最终被强迫，也给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A&#39;\\le_TS\">\\(A&#39;\\le_TS\\)</span> 的完整归纳算法。</p>\n<p>原书提示最后的稳定阶段须同时等待较小正跳跃指标已完成强迫；仅知道 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_s\\upharpoonright e\">\\(S_s\\upharpoonright e\\)</span> 稳定而忽略这些仍可能写入低列的行动，不足以完成该证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.5.15；Remark 6.5.14；印刷页 145, 146；PDF 第 179, 180 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-partial-compatibility","status":"resolved","id":"8cea21e174a04417","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-compatibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-relative-ce","status":"resolved","id":"2c15e9656c322806","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-relative-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"e890b3c29e4a70a3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-relative-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d984717bb6601580","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-relative-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o