airing]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-limit]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-jump","status":"resolved","id":"2ea8548c98f572c3","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-compatibility]]；see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-thm-relative-limit]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'\\le_TS","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in\\mathcal E^{\\varnothing'}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}shoenfield\\text{-}inversion\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\exists A\\subseteq\\omega\\ [A\\le_T\\varnothing'\\land A'\\equiv_TS].","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"S_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_s","display":false},{"tex":"F_s","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in S_s","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin S_s","display":false},{"tex":"s+1","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"e\\notin F_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_s","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^\\pi(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"y<e","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"F_s","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\le s","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"A\\le_T\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_sF_s\\subseteq A'","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"y\\notin S","display":false},{"tex":"e\\le y","display":false},{"tex":"y+1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\lim_x\\chi_A(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\chi_S(y).","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"S\\le_TA'","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in A'","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"i<e","display":false},{"tex":"S_s\\upharpoonright e=S\\upharpoonright e","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"i<e","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing'\\le_TS","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"y<e","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A(e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_s","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"A'\\le_TS","display":false},{"tex":"S_s\\upharpoonright e","display":false}],"bytes":4246,"backlinks":[{"id":"cbf9dd72b30d4b48","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]；see [[20-df-jump]]；see [[20-df-relative-ce]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。"},{"id":"15cf85fd84eaf3f9","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"既有路线可继续阅读：动态枚举 [[20-thm-friedberg-dynamic-splitting]]；反演与精确对 [[20-lem-shoenfield-inversion-set]]、[[20-thm-exact-pair]]；有限损伤 [[20-thm-low-simple]]、[[20-thm-fm]]、[[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；Δ₂ 扩展 [[20-thm-delta2-cone-avoidance]]、[[20-thm-countable-delta2-splitting]]；基定理 [[20-thm-low-basis]]、[[20-thm-superlow-basis]]；博弈 [[20-thm-banach-mazur]]、[[20-thm-open-winning-strategy-compiler]]、[[20-thm-no-total-open-strategy-selection]]。"}],"outgoing":["8cea21e174a04417","755e421576224435","2c15e9656c322806","e890b3c29e4a70a3","d984717bb6601580","35073b74f84433b3","2ea8548c98f572c3"]}